### Phase 3.2: Admin Features - HTTP Test Suite
### Base URL: http://localhost:3001

### Variables
@base_url = http://localhost:3001
@admin_token = {ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN}
@customer_token = {CUSTOMER_JWT_TOKEN}
@seller_token = {SELLER_JWT_TOKEN}
@invalid_token = invalid.token.here
@test_user_id = {TARGET_USER_ID}

---

### Test 1: Get All Users - Default Pagination
### Expected: 200 OK with paginated user list
### Requires: ADMIN role
GET {{base_url}}/api/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

---

### Test 2: Get All Users - Custom Page Size
### Expected: 200 OK with 10 users per page
GET {{base_url}}/api/admin/users?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

---

### Test 3: Get All Users - With Sorting
### Expected: 200 OK sorted by email ascending
GET {{base_url}}/api/admin/users?sort=email,asc
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

---

### Test 4: Get All Users - Multiple Sort Criteria
### Expected: 200 OK sorted by createdAt descending, then email ascending
GET {{base_url}}/api/admin/users?sort=createdAt,desc&sort=email,asc
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

---

### Test 5: Get All Users - Large Page Number
### Expected: 200 OK (empty or partial page depending on data)
GET {{base_url}}/api/admin/users?page=100&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

---

### Test 6: Update User Roles - Add SELLER Role
### Expected: 200 OK with updated user having SELLER role
PUT {{base_url}}/api/admin/users/{{test_user_id}}/role
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roles": ["ROLE_CUSTOMER", "ROLE_SELLER"]
}

---

### Test 7: Update User Roles - Admin Only
### Expected: 200 OK with user having only ADMIN role
PUT {{base_url}}/api/admin/users/{{test_user_id}}/role
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roles": ["ROLE_ADMIN"]
}

---

### Test 8: Update User Roles - Single Role (Customer)
### Expected: 200 OK with user having CUSTOMER role
PUT {{base_url}}/api/admin/users/{{test_user_id}}/role
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roles": ["ROLE_CUSTOMER"]
}

---

### Test 9: Update User Roles - Multiple Roles
### Expected: 200 OK with user having all three roles
PUT {{base_url}}/api/admin/users/{{test_user_id}}/role
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roles": ["ROLE_CUSTOMER", "ROLE_SELLER", "ROLE_ADMIN"]
}

---

### Test 10: Access Denied - Customer Trying to Get All Users
### Expected: 403 Forbidden
GET {{base_url}}/api/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}

---

### Test 11: Access Denied - Seller Trying to Update Roles
### Expected: 403 Forbidden
PUT {{base_url}}/api/admin/users/{{test_user_id}}/role
Authorization: Bearer {{seller_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roles": ["ROLE_ADMIN"]
}

---

### Test 12: Validation Error - Empty Roles
### Expected: 400 Bad Request - "Roles cannot be empty"
PUT {{base_url}}/api/admin/users/{{test_user_id}}/role
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roles": []
}

---

### Test 13: Validation Error - Null Roles
### Expected: 400 Bad Request
PUT {{base_url}}/api/admin/users/{{test_user_id}}/role
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
}

---

### Test 14: Not Found - Invalid User ID
### Expected: 404 Not Found - "User not found"
PUT {{base_url}}/api/admin/users/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/role
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roles": ["ROLE_CUSTOMER"]
}

---

### Test 15: Unauthorized - Missing Token (Get Users)
### Expected: 401 Unauthorized
GET {{base_url}}/api/admin/users

---

### Test 16: Unauthorized - Missing Token (Update Roles)
### Expected: 401 Unauthorized
PUT {{base_url}}/api/admin/users/{{test_user_id}}/role
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roles": ["ROLE_ADMIN"]
}

---

### Test 17: Unauthorized - Invalid Token Format
### Expected: 401 Unauthorized
GET {{base_url}}/api/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{invalid_token}}

---

### Test 18: Pagination - Second Page
### Expected: 200 OK with users on page 1
GET {{base_url}}/api/admin/users?page=1&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

---

### Test 19: Sorting - By Created Date Descending
### Expected: 200 OK with newest users first
GET {{base_url}}/api/admin/users?sort=createdAt,desc
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

---

### Test 20: Combined - Pagination + Sorting
### Expected: 200 OK with page 2, 15 items per page, sorted by email
GET {{base_url}}/api/admin/users?page=2&size=15&sort=email,asc
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

---

## Notes:
# Replace {{admin_token}} with actual JWT token containing ROLE_ADMIN
# Replace {{customer_token}} with JWT token containing ROLE_CUSTOMER
# Replace {{seller_token}} with JWT token containing ROLE_SELLER
# Replace {{test_user_id}} with an actual user ID from the database
# Run tests sequentially to verify all scenarios
# Monitor logs for detailed operation information

